# T247: bare-form fallback for the whole /currencies/* alias set above.
# There is no live Next.js server (static export) to 308 a request like
# `/currencies/xlm` onto `/currencies/xlm/` the way the removed comments
# here used to claim, so without this it 404s on Cloudflare Pages. This
# one rule normalizes any bare-form, single-segment request onto the
# trailing-slash form, which then re-matches its specific slug rule above
# (two redirect hops, same destination) — covering every current and
# future /currencies/* alias without doubling the per-slug table. `:slug`
# (not `*`) deliberately matches only a path with no trailing slash: a
# splat would also re-match already-trailing-slash / unmapped paths and
# loop, growing an extra slash each hop instead of 404ing cleanly.
/currencies/:slug  /currencies/:slug/  301

